{"3645650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Athyra: Rock, Paper, Scissors", "steam_appid": 3645650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/3c19419c3f41745742975d1bc35dadf1.poster.avif?t=1763497591\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/3c19419c3f41745742975d1bc35dadf1.webm?t=1763497591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/3c19419c3f41745742975d1bc35dadf1.mp4?t=1763497591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>From the creator of... absolutely nothing else so far...</strong><br>...comes the latest confusing mess of a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Athyra</i> takes the simplest game everyone knows—Rock, Paper, Scissors—and turns it into the most complicated horror experience that not many understand (including maybe the developer).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unsettling opponents, solve cryptic puzzles, and try not to question your sanity—or the rules. Because yes, there are rules. Probably. Somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, it’s a horror game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/6f16288eda640ecd91dbef89586209ab.poster.avif?t=1763497591\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/6f16288eda640ecd91dbef89586209ab.webm?t=1763497591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/6f16288eda640ecd91dbef89586209ab.mp4?t=1763497591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>In <i>Athyra</i>, you will...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against twisted, unsettling opponents in the simplest game you've ever known... or thought you knew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover cryptic puzzles and unsettling lore as you venture deeper into the trial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore rooms full of horrors, all linked by a bizarre, unnerving connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question everything... including the game itself.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/3c19419c3f41745742975d1bc35dadf1.poster.avif?t=1763497591\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/3c19419c3f41745742975d1bc35dadf1.webm?t=1763497591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/3c19419c3f41745742975d1bc35dadf1.mp4?t=1763497591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>From the creator of... absolutely nothing else so far...</strong><br>...comes the latest confusing mess of a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Athyra</i> takes the simplest game everyone knows—Rock, Paper, Scissors—and turns it into the most complicated horror experience that not many understand (including maybe the developer).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unsettling opponents, solve cryptic puzzles, and try not to question your sanity—or the rules. Because yes, there are rules. Probably. Somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, it’s a horror game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin